<v Ira Glass>Adriana Cardona-Maguigad did a lot of our investigation into Puerto Rican drug addicts as a fellow with the Social Justice News Nexus at Northwestern University. She went to Puerto Rico with support from the Fund for Investigative Journalism. Bill Healy, Kari Lyderson, and the Center for Investigative Journalism in Puerto Rico helped with reporting.
<v Ira Glass>Adriana Cardona-Maguigad作为西北大学社会正义新闻Nexus的研究员，完成了我们对波多黎各瘾君子的大量调查。她在调查新闻基金的支持下去了波多黎各。Bill Healy, Kari Lyderson，和波多黎各调查新闻中心帮助了报道。

00:59:53.870 --> 01:00:11.660
