<v Ira Glass>[致谢]

01:00:11.660 --> 01:00:29.570
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks as always today to our program's co-founder, Mr. Tory Malatia. He's doing this new thing where whenever he walks out of a room, he says, hasta la vista, baby. And then he turns and says--
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《这就是美国生活》由PRX，公共广播交换中心发送到公共广播电台。一如既往感谢我们节目的联合创始人，Tory Malatia先生。他在做这个新事情，每当他走出房间时，他说，hasta la vista, baby（再见，宝贝）。然后他转身说——

01:00:29.570 --> 01:00:33.280
<v Alexis>That's not racist because I'm in Spanish 3, so I know Spanish.
<v Alexis>那不是种族主义，因为我在西班牙语3，所以我懂西班牙语。

01:00:33.280 --> 01:00:37.810
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是Ira Glass。下周回来，带着更多《这就是美国生活》的故事。

01:00:37.810 --> 01:00:42.810
